WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.014 --> 00:00:07.384
Start by opening Ultimate Joystick.

2
00:00:07.409 --> 00:00:14.361
Confirm connection status before setup.

3
00:00:14.395 --> 00:00:20.071
Set MAME, ROM, and XML paths.

4
00:00:20.092 --> 00:00:24.841
Calibrate servo positions carefully.

5
00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:28.731
Assign games to the gate shapes they need.

6
00:00:28.748 --> 00:00:32.931
Start monitoring when setup is ready.

7
00:00:32.944 --> 00:00:38.011
The selected game displays the assigned gate.

8
00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:43.681
Configure splash warnings and safety timing.

9
00:00:43.694 --> 00:00:49.601
Stop monitoring and close only from a safe state.
